  "notes": [
    "Receiver evaluated once and classified before lowering; this is only an effect admission model, not full typed HIR or a compiler.",
    "BorrowRead and BorrowWrite preserve the region owner. ConsumeReceiver requires direct unique owner authority and no live loans.",
